  m_Name: BossHerald
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.BossStats
  maxHealth: 70
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 1000
  description: It announces the wall, then becomes it. The horn is longer than the
    argument, and the spores carry the proclamation further than any voice could.
  tactics: Sweeping telegraphed walls with deliberate gaps, plus aimed jabs to herd
    you. Find the gap EARLY - the wall crosses slowly but totally. Below half HP
    (Judgement, white tint) a rotating cross joins; track the cross's turn and treat
    the walls as the metronome.
